---
export interface Props {
  activeRoute?: "root" | "section";
  sectionParam?: string;
}

const { activeRoute = "root", sectionParam = "" } = Astro.props;
const canonicalUrl = new URL("/", Astro.url).toString();
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Finance Tracker 2026</title>
  <link rel="canonical" href={canonicalUrl} />
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css" />
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.7/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
  <script>
    import "../scripts/app";
    import "../scripts/issue-report";
  </script>
</head>
<body data-route={activeRoute} data-section={sectionParam}>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#app-main">Saltar al contenido</a>
  <div class="bg-layer"></div>
  <div class="app-shell">
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <header class="brand-block">
        <p class="brand-kicker">Plan financiero</p>
        <h1>Finance Tracker</h1>
        <p class="brand-sub">Reemplazo completo de tu Excel con una experiencia más clara y rápida.</p>
      </header>

      <nav class="nav" id="nav-tabs" aria-label="Secciones del tracker">
        <button type="button" class="nav-btn is-active" data-section="dashboard" aria-controls="dashboard" aria-current="page">Dashboard</button>
        <button type="button" class="nav-btn" data-section="transactions" aria-controls="transactions">Movimientos</button>
        <button type="button" class="nav-btn" data-section="budget" aria-controls="budget">Presupuesto</button>
        <button type="button" class="nav-btn" data-section="wealth" aria-controls="wealth">Patrimonio</button>
        <button type="button" class="nav-btn" data-section="investment" aria-controls="investment">Inversión</button>
        <button type="button" class="nav-btn" data-section="goals" aria-controls="goals">Objetivos</button>
        <button type="button" class="nav-btn" data-section="settings" aria-controls="settings">Configuración</button>
        <button type="button" class="nav-btn" data-section="data" aria-controls="data">Datos</button>
        <button type="button" class="nav-btn" data-section="reports" aria-controls="reports">Reportes</button>
      </nav>

      <footer class="sidebar-footer">
        <p id="save-status">Sincronizado</p>
      </footer>
    </aside>

    <main id="app-main" class="content">
      <section id="dashboard" class="panel is-active" aria-labelledby="dashboard-title">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <div>
            <h2 id="dashboard-title">Resumen mensual y anual</h2>
            <p>Visualización equivalente a RESUMEN MENSUAL + RESUMEN ANUAL.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="inline-controls">
            <label>
              Año
              <input id="year-display" name="yearDisplay" type="number" min="2000" max="2100" autocomplete="off" />
            </label>
            <label>
              Mes
              <select id="dashboard-month" name="dashboardMonth"></select>
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cards-grid" id="kpi-cards">
          <article class="kpi-card">
            <p>Ingresos del mes</p>
            <strong id="kpi-income">€0</strong>
          </article>
          <article class="kpi-card">
            <p>Gastos del mes</p>
            <strong id="kpi-expense">€0</strong>
          </article>
          <article class="kpi-card">
            <p>Inversión del mes</p>
            <strong id="kpi-investment">€0</strong>
          </article>
          <article class="kpi-card">
            <p>Patrimonio neto</p>
            <strong id="kpi-net-worth">€0</strong>
          </article>
          <article class="kpi-card">
            <p>Ahorro anual</p>
            <strong id="kpi-annual-savings">€0</strong>
          </article>
          <article class="kpi-card">
            <p>Crecimiento YTD</p>
            <strong id="kpi-growth">0%</strong>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="chart-grid">
          <div class="chart-stack">
            <article class="chart-card">
              <h3>Evolución patrimonio neto</h3>
              <div class="chart-canvas-wrap"><canvas id="chart-networth" aria-label="Evolución de patrimonio"></canvas></div>
            </article>
            <article class="chart-card">
              <h3>Ingresos vs Gastos vs Inversión</h3>
              <div class="chart-canvas-wrap"><canvas id="chart-cashflow" aria-label="Flujo mensual"></canvas></div>
            </article>
            <article class="chart-card">
              <h3>Distribución actual</h3>
              <div class="chart-canvas-wrap"><canvas id="chart-distribution" aria-label="Distribución de patrimonio"></canvas></div>
            </article>
          </div>
          <aside class="chart-side">
            <article class="chart-card top-expense-card">
              <h3>Top gastos del mes</h3>
              <div id="top-expense-list" class="list-stack"></div>
            </article>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="transactions" class="panel" aria-labelledby="transactions-title">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <div>
            <h2 id="transactions-title">Movimientos mensuales</h2>
            <p>Registro diario de ingresos, gastos e inversión por mes.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="inline-controls">
            <label>
              Filtrar mes
              <select id="tx-month-filter" name="txMonthFilter"></select>
            </label>
            <button id="tx-open-modal" type="button" class="primary-btn">Nuevo</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <article class="card tx-bulk-card">
          <h3>Selección múltiple</h3>
          <div class="tx-bulk-grid">
            <p id="tx-selected-count" class="tx-selected-count">0 seleccionadas</p>
            <label>
              Tipo (lote)
              <select id="tx-bulk-type" name="txBulkType">
                <option value="">Sin cambio</option>
                <option value="income">Ingreso</option>
                <option value="expense">Gasto</option>
                <option value="investment">Inversión</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label>
              Cuenta (lote)
              <select id="tx-bulk-account" name="txBulkAccount">
                <option value="">Sin cambio</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label>
              Categoría (lote)
              <input id="tx-bulk-category" name="txBulkCategory" type="text" placeholder="Sin cambio" autocomplete="off" />
            </label>
            <button id="tx-bulk-apply" type="button" class="secondary-btn">Aplicar</button>
            <button id="tx-bulk-delete" type="button" class="danger-btn">Eliminar</button>
          </div>
        </article>

        <dialog id="tx-dialog" class="tx-dialog">
          <form id="tx-form" class="tx-form-dialog" method="dialog" autocomplete="off">
            <div class="tx-dialog-head">
              <div class="tx-dialog-title">
                <span class="tx-dialog-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
                <h3>Nuevo movimiento</h3>
              </div>
              <button id="tx-close-modal" type="button" class="tx-close-btn" aria-label="Cerrar">✕</button>
            </div>
            <div class="tx-form-fields">
              <label>
                Fecha
                <input type="date" name="date" required autocomplete="off" />
              </label>
              <label>
                Mes
                <select name="month" required></select>
              </label>
              <label>
                Tipo
                <select name="type" required id="tx-type-select">
                  <option value="income">Ingreso</option>
                  <option value="expense">Gasto</option>
                  <option value="investment">Inversión</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <label>
                Cuenta
                <select name="accountId" required></select>
              </label>
              <label>
                Categoría
                <select name="category" required></select>
              </label>
              <label class="span-3">
                Descripción
                <input type="text" name="description" maxlength="140" placeholder="Detalle opcional" autocomplete="off" />
              </label>
              <label class="tx-amount-field">
                Importe
                <div class="tx-amount-wrap">
                  <span class="tx-amount-currency">€</span>
                  <input type="number" name="amount" min="0" step="0.01" required placeholder="0.00" autocomplete="off" />
                </div>
              </label>
            </div>
            <div class="tx-dialog-actions">
              <button id="tx-submit-more" type="submit" class="tx-btn-secondary">Otro</button>
              <button type="submit" class="tx-btn-primary">Guardar</button>
            </div>
          </form>
        </dialog>

        <div class="tx-layout">
          <div class="table-wrap">
            <table>
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th class="tx-col-select">
                    <input id="tx-select-all" name="txSelectAll" type="checkbox" aria-label="Seleccionar todas las filas visibles" />
                  </th>
                  <th class="tx-head tx-head--filterable" data-filter-column="date">
                    <div class="tx-head-main">
                      <button type="button" class="tx-filter-trigger" data-column="date" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false">Fecha</button>
                      <button type="button" class="tx-sort-btn" data-column="date" aria-label="Ordenar por fecha">↕</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tx-filter-popover" data-column="date" hidden>
                      <label for="tx-header-filter-date">Filtrar fecha</label>
                      <input id="tx-header-filter-date" name="txHeaderFilterDate" type="date" autocomplete="off" />
                      <button type="button" class="tx-header-clear-btn" data-column="date">Limpiar</button>
                    </div>
                  </th>
                  <th class="tx-head tx-head--filterable" data-filter-column="description">
                    <div class="tx-head-main">
                      <button type="button" class="tx-filter-trigger" data-column="description" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false">Descripción</button>
                      <button type="button" class="tx-sort-btn" data-column="description" aria-label="Ordenar por descripción">↕</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tx-filter-popover" data-column="description" hidden>
                      <label for="tx-header-filter-description">Descripción</label>
                      <input id="tx-header-filter-description" name="txHeaderFilterDescription" type="text" placeholder="Contiene..." autocomplete="off" />
                      <button type="button" class="tx-header-clear-btn" data-column="description">Limpiar</button>
                    </div>
                  </th>
                  <th class="tx-head tx-head--filterable" data-filter-column="amount">
                    <div class="tx-head-main">
                      <button type="button" class="tx-filter-trigger" data-column="amount" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false">Importe</button>
                      <button type="button" class="tx-sort-btn" data-column="amount" aria-label="Ordenar por importe">↕</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tx-filter-popover" data-column="amount" hidden>
                      <label for="tx-header-filter-amount-min">Importe mín</label>
                      <input id="tx-header-filter-amount-min" name="txHeaderFilterAmountMin" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" autocomplete="off" />
                      <label for="tx-header-filter-amount-max">Importe máx</label>
                      <input id="tx-header-filter-amount-max" name="txHeaderFilterAmountMax" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" autocomplete="off" />
                      <button type="button" class="tx-header-clear-btn" data-column="amount">Limpiar</button>
                    </div>
                  </th>
                  <th class="tx-head tx-head--filterable" data-filter-column="account">
                    <div class="tx-head-main">
                      <button type="button" class="tx-filter-trigger" data-column="account" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false">Cuenta</button>
                      <button type="button" class="tx-sort-btn" data-column="account" aria-label="Ordenar por cuenta">↕</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tx-filter-popover" data-column="account" hidden>
                      <label>Cuenta</label>
                      <div id="tx-header-filter-account" class="tx-checkbox-list" aria-label="Filtrar cuentas"></div>
                      <button type="button" class="tx-header-clear-btn" data-column="account">Limpiar</button>
                    </div>
                  </th>
                  <th class="tx-head tx-head--filterable" data-filter-column="type">
                    <div class="tx-head-main">
                      <button type="button" class="tx-filter-trigger" data-column="type" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false">Tipo</button>
                      <button type="button" class="tx-sort-btn" data-column="type" aria-label="Ordenar por tipo">↕</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tx-filter-popover" data-column="type" hidden>
                      <label>Tipo</label>
                      <div id="tx-header-filter-type" class="tx-checkbox-list" aria-label="Filtrar tipos"></div>
                      <button type="button" class="tx-header-clear-btn" data-column="type">Limpiar</button>
                    </div>
                  </th>
                  <th class="tx-head tx-head--filterable" data-filter-column="category">
                    <div class="tx-head-main">
                      <button type="button" class="tx-filter-trigger" data-column="category" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false">Categoría</button>
                      <button type="button" class="tx-sort-btn" data-column="category" aria-label="Ordenar por categoría">↕</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tx-filter-popover" data-column="category" hidden>
                      <label for="tx-header-filter-category">Categoría</label>
                      <input id="tx-header-filter-category" name="txHeaderFilterCategory" type="text" placeholder="Contiene..." autocomplete="off" />
                      <button type="button" class="tx-header-clear-btn" data-column="category">Limpiar</button>
                    </div>
                  </th>
                  <th>Acciones</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody id="tx-table-body"></tbody>
            </table>
          </div>

          <aside class="tx-summary-side" aria-label="Resumen de movimientos">
            <article class="tx-summary-card">
              <table class="tx-summary-table tx-summary-table--totals">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th colspan="3" class="tx-summary-title">TOTAL</th>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <th class="tx-summary-heading tx-summary-heading--income">INGRESOS</th>
                    <th class="tx-summary-heading tx-summary-heading--expense">GASTOS</th>
                    <th class="tx-summary-heading tx-summary-heading--investment">INVERSIÓN</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr>
                    <td id="tx-total-income" class="tx-summary-total-value">0 €</td>
                    <td id="tx-total-expense" class="tx-summary-total-value">0 €</td>
                    <td id="tx-total-investment" class="tx-summary-total-value">0 €</td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </article>

            <article class="tx-summary-card">
              <table class="tx-summary-table tx-summary-table--breakdown">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th class="tx-summary-title">DESGLOSE POR CATEGORÍAS</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="tx-category-breakdown-body"></tbody>
              </table>
            </article>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="budget" class="panel" aria-labelledby="budget-title">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <div>
            <h2 id="budget-title">Presupuesto</h2>
            <p>Compara presupuestado vs real por categoría y mes.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="inline-controls">
            <label>
              Tipo
              <select id="budget-type" name="budgetType">
                <option value="income">Ingresos</option>
                <option value="expense">Gastos</option>
                <option value="investment">Inversión</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label>
              Mes
              <select id="budget-month" name="budgetMonth"></select>
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cards-grid slim">
          <article class="kpi-card">
            <p>Presupuestado mes</p>
            <strong id="budget-total-planned">€0</strong>
          </article>
          <article class="kpi-card">
            <p>Real mes</p>
            <strong id="budget-total-actual">€0</strong>
          </article>
          <article class="kpi-card">
            <p>Diferencia mes</p>
            <strong id="budget-total-diff">€0</strong>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Categoría</th>
                <th>Presupuesto</th>
                <th>Real</th>
                <th>Diferencia</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id="budget-table-body"></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="wealth" class="panel" aria-labelledby="wealth-title">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <div>
            <h2 id="wealth-title">Patrimonio total</h2>
            <p>Liquidez + inversión - deuda, con snapshots mensuales manuales.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="inline-controls">
            <label>
              Mes snapshot
              <select id="snapshot-month" name="snapshotMonth"></select>
            </label>
            <button id="save-snapshot" class="primary-btn" type="button">Guardar snapshot</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="dual-grid">
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Liquidez</h3>
            <div class="table-wrap compact">
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Cuenta</th>
                    <th>Apertura</th>
                    <th>Calculado</th>
                    <th>Snapshot</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="snapshot-accounts"></tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Inversión</h3>
            <div class="table-wrap compact">
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Activo</th>
                    <th>Apertura</th>
                    <th>Calculado</th>
                    <th>Snapshot</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="snapshot-investments"></tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Deuda / Pasivos</h3>
            <div class="table-wrap compact">
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Item</th>
                    <th>Apertura</th>
                    <th>Calculado</th>
                    <th>Snapshot</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="snapshot-liabilities"></tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Evolución mensual</h3>
            <div class="chart-canvas-wrap"><canvas id="chart-wealth" aria-label="Evolución mensual patrimonio"></canvas></div>
            <div class="table-wrap compact">
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Mes</th>
                    <th>Liquidez</th>
                    <th>Inversión</th>
                    <th>Deuda</th>
                    <th>Neto</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="wealth-timeline-body"></tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>

        <dialog id="wealth-calc-dialog" class="wealth-calc-dialog">
          <form id="wealth-calc-form" class="wealth-calc-form" method="dialog" autocomplete="off">
            <div class="wealth-calc-head">
              <h3 id="wealth-calc-title">Calcular snapshot</h3>
              <button id="wealth-calc-close" type="button" class="tx-close-btn" aria-label="Cerrar cálculo">✕</button>
            </div>
            <label>
              Cálculo numérico
              <input
                id="wealth-calc-expression"
                name="wealthCalcExpression"
                type="text"
                placeholder="Ej: 1200+35,5*2"
                autocomplete="off"
              />
            </label>
            <div class="wealth-calc-actions">
              <button id="wealth-calc-apply" type="submit" class="tx-btn-primary">Aplicar al snapshot</button>
            </div>
          </form>
        </dialog>
      </section>

      <section id="investment" class="panel" aria-labelledby="investment-title">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <div>
            <h2 id="investment-title">Inversión y aportes</h2>
            <p>Evolución de cartera, distribución y registro de aportaciones.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="inline-controls">
            <label>
              Mes de análisis
              <select id="investment-month" name="investmentMonth"></select>
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cards-grid slim">
          <article class="kpi-card">
            <p>Valor cartera</p>
            <strong id="inv-total-value">€0</strong>
          </article>
          <article class="kpi-card">
            <p>Capital invertido</p>
            <strong id="inv-capital">€0</strong>
          </article>
          <article class="kpi-card">
            <p>Rentabilidad estimada</p>
            <strong id="inv-return">0%</strong>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="chart-grid-inv">
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Evolución de la cartera</h3>
            <div class="chart-canvas-wrap"><canvas id="investment-portfolio-chart" aria-label="Evolución cartera total"></canvas></div>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Evolución por activo</h3>
            <div class="chart-canvas-wrap"><canvas id="investment-assets-chart" aria-label="Evolución por activo"></canvas></div>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="dual-grid">
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Distribución de activos</h3>
            <div class="chart-canvas-wrap"><canvas id="investment-allocation" aria-label="Distribución de cartera"></canvas></div>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Aportes y TWR aproximado</h3>
            <form id="contribution-form" class="form-grid compact" autocomplete="off">
              <label>
                Fecha
                <input type="date" name="date" required autocomplete="off" />
              </label>
              <label>
                Aporte
                <input type="number" name="amount" step="0.01" min="0" required autocomplete="off" />
              </label>
              <label>
                Valor cartera
                <input type="number" name="portfolioValue" step="0.01" min="0" required autocomplete="off" />
              </label>
              <label>
                Flujo del día
                <input type="number" name="flow" step="0.01" autocomplete="off" />
              </label>
              <button type="submit" class="primary-btn">Agregar aporte</button>
            </form>
            <div class="table-wrap compact">
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Fecha</th>
                    <th>Aporte</th>
                    <th>Valor cartera</th>
                    <th>Flujo</th>
                    <th>VLE</th>
                    <th>Retorno</th>
                    <th>Acciones</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="contribution-body"></tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="goals" class="panel" aria-labelledby="goals-title">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <div>
            <h2 id="goals-title">Objetivos</h2>
            <p>Seguimiento de metas patrimoniales y de inversión.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="goal-edit-grid">
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Corto plazo</h3>
            <label>Nombre <input type="text" name="goalShortName" data-goal="short" data-field="name" autocomplete="off" /></label>
            <label>Año objetivo <input type="number" name="goalShortYear" data-goal="short" data-field="targetYear" min="2000" max="2100" autocomplete="off" /></label>
            <label>Monto objetivo <input type="number" name="goalShortAmount" data-goal="short" data-field="targetAmount" min="0" step="0.01" autocomplete="off" /></label>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Medio plazo</h3>
            <label>Nombre <input type="text" name="goalMediumName" data-goal="medium" data-field="name" autocomplete="off" /></label>
            <label>Año objetivo <input type="number" name="goalMediumYear" data-goal="medium" data-field="targetYear" min="2000" max="2100" autocomplete="off" /></label>
            <label>Monto objetivo <input type="number" name="goalMediumAmount" data-goal="medium" data-field="targetAmount" min="0" step="0.01" autocomplete="off" /></label>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Largo plazo</h3>
            <label>Nombre <input type="text" name="goalLongName" data-goal="long" data-field="name" autocomplete="off" /></label>
            <label>Año objetivo <input type="number" name="goalLongYear" data-goal="long" data-field="targetYear" min="2000" max="2100" autocomplete="off" /></label>
            <label>Monto objetivo <input type="number" name="goalLongAmount" data-goal="long" data-field="targetAmount" min="0" step="0.01" autocomplete="off" /></label>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Inversión total</h3>
            <label>Nombre <input type="text" name="goalInvestmentTotalName" data-goal="investmentTotal" data-field="name" autocomplete="off" /></label>
            <label>Año objetivo <input type="number" name="goalInvestmentTotalYear" data-goal="investmentTotal" data-field="targetYear" min="2000" max="2100" autocomplete="off" /></label>
            <label>Monto objetivo <input type="number" name="goalInvestmentTotalAmount" data-goal="investmentTotal" data-field="targetAmount" min="0" step="0.01" autocomplete="off" /></label>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Fondos indexados</h3>
            <label>Nombre <input type="text" name="goalInvestmentFundsName" data-goal="investmentFunds" data-field="name" autocomplete="off" /></label>
            <label>Año objetivo <input type="number" name="goalInvestmentFundsYear" data-goal="investmentFunds" data-field="targetYear" min="2000" max="2100" autocomplete="off" /></label>
            <label>Monto objetivo <input type="number" name="goalInvestmentFundsAmount" data-goal="investmentFunds" data-field="targetAmount" min="0" step="0.01" autocomplete="off" /></label>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Criptomonedas</h3>
            <label>Nombre <input type="text" name="goalInvestmentCryptoName" data-goal="investmentCrypto" data-field="name" autocomplete="off" /></label>
            <label>Año objetivo <input type="number" name="goalInvestmentCryptoYear" data-goal="investmentCrypto" data-field="targetYear" min="2000" max="2100" autocomplete="off" /></label>
            <label>Monto objetivo <input type="number" name="goalInvestmentCryptoAmount" data-goal="investmentCrypto" data-field="targetAmount" min="0" step="0.01" autocomplete="off" /></label>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div id="goals-progress" class="goal-progress"></div>
      </section>

      <section id="settings" class="panel" aria-labelledby="settings-title">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <div>
            <h2 id="settings-title">Configuración base</h2>
            <p>Gestiona cuentas, activos, categorías y datos maestros.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="settings-head">
            <label>
              Año
              <input id="settings-year" name="settingsYear" type="number" min="2000" max="2100" autocomplete="off" />
            </label>
            <label>
              Moneda
              <input id="settings-currency" name="settingsCurrency" type="text" maxlength="3" autocomplete="off" />
            </label>
          <button id="save-settings-main" type="button" class="primary-btn">Guardar ajustes</button>
        </div>

        <div class="dual-grid">
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Cuentas de liquidez</h3>
            <form id="add-account-form" class="mini-form" autocomplete="off">
              <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Nombre cuenta" required autocomplete="off" />
              <input type="number" name="openingBalance" step="0.01" min="0" placeholder="Saldo inicial" required autocomplete="off" />
              <button type="submit" class="secondary-btn">Agregar</button>
            </form>
            <div id="settings-accounts" class="list-stack"></div>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>Activos de inversión</h3>
            <form id="add-investment-form" class="mini-form" autocomplete="off">
              <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Activo" required autocomplete="off" />
              <input type="number" name="openingBalance" step="0.01" min="0" placeholder="Valor inicial" required autocomplete="off" />
              <button type="submit" class="secondary-btn">Agregar</button>
            </form>
            <div id="settings-investments" class="list-stack"></div>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>Pasivos / deudas</h3>
            <form id="add-liability-form" class="mini-form" autocomplete="off">
              <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Pasivo" required autocomplete="off" />
              <input type="number" name="openingBalance" step="0.01" min="0" placeholder="Monto inicial" required autocomplete="off" />
              <button type="submit" class="secondary-btn">Agregar</button>
            </form>
            <div id="settings-liabilities" class="list-stack"></div>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>Categorías</h3>
            <div class="category-block">
              <h4>Ingresos</h4>
              <form id="add-income-category" class="mini-form compact-row" autocomplete="off">
                <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Nueva categoría" required autocomplete="off" />
                <button type="submit" class="secondary-btn">Agregar</button>
              </form>
              <div id="settings-income-categories" class="tag-wrap"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="category-block">
              <h4>Gastos</h4>
              <form id="add-expense-category" class="mini-form compact-row" autocomplete="off">
                <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Nueva categoría" required autocomplete="off" />
                <button type="submit" class="secondary-btn">Agregar</button>
              </form>
              <div id="settings-expense-categories" class="tag-wrap"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="category-block">
              <h4>Inversión</h4>
              <form id="add-investment-category" class="mini-form compact-row" autocomplete="off">
                <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Nueva categoría" required autocomplete="off" />
                <button type="submit" class="secondary-btn">Agregar</button>
              </form>
              <div id="settings-investment-categories" class="tag-wrap"></div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="data" class="panel" aria-labelledby="data-title">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <div>
            <h2 id="data-title">Datos y backups</h2>
            <p>Exporta, importa y reinicia el tracker sin perder historial.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cards-grid slim">
          <article class="kpi-card">
            <p>Movimientos</p>
            <strong id="data-total-transactions">0</strong>
          </article>
          <article class="kpi-card">
            <p>Snapshots</p>
            <strong id="data-total-snapshots">0</strong>
          </article>
          <article class="kpi-card">
            <p>Aportes</p>
            <strong id="data-total-contributions">0</strong>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="data-actions">
          <button id="export-json" class="primary-btn" type="button">Exportar JSON</button>
          <label class="file-btn">
            Importar JSON
            <input id="import-json" name="importJson" type="file" accept="application/json" aria-label="Importar archivo JSON" />
          </label>
          <button id="export-transactions-csv" class="secondary-btn" type="button">Exportar movimientos CSV</button>
          <button id="reset-seed" class="danger-btn" type="button">Reiniciar con datos semilla</button>
        </div>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Estado</h3>
          <p id="data-meta"></p>
        </article>

      </section>

      <section id="reports" class="panel" aria-labelledby="reports-title">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <div>
            <h2 id="reports-title">Reportes y automatización</h2>
            <p>Crea issues con contexto para activar el flujo automático con Claude.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="reports-layout">
          <article class="card reports-form-card">
            <header class="reports-form-head">
              <p class="reports-kicker">Issue generator</p>
              <h3>Reportar error o mejora</h3>
              <p>Describe el problema con detalle y lo enviamos como issue para activar flujo automático.</p>
            </header>

            <form id="issue-report-form" autocomplete="off" novalidate>
              <label>
                Tipo
                <select id="issue-report-type" name="type" required>
                  <option value="bug">Error</option>
                  <option value="enhancement">Mejora</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <label class="span-3">
                Resumen
                <input
                  id="issue-report-summary"
                  name="summary"
                  type="text"
                  minlength="5"
                  maxlength="140"
                  required
                  placeholder="Ej. El filtro de movimientos no guarda el valor"
                  autocomplete="off"
                />
              </label>
              <label class="span-3">
                Descripción
                <textarea
                  id="issue-report-description"
                  name="description"
                  minlength="12"
                  maxlength="8000"
                  required
                  rows="4"
                  placeholder="Describe el error o mejora con el mayor detalle posible."
                ></textarea>
              </label>
              <label>
                Resultado esperado (opcional)
                <textarea id="issue-report-expected" name="expectedResult" maxlength="4000" rows="3"></textarea>
              </label>
              <label>
                Resultado actual (opcional)
                <textarea id="issue-report-actual" name="actualResult" maxlength="4000" rows="3"></textarea>
              </label>
              <label class="span-3">
                Pasos para reproducir (opcional)
                <textarea
                  id="issue-report-steps"
                  name="stepsToReproduce"
                  maxlength="5000"
                  rows="3"
                  placeholder="1. Ir a ... 2. Pulsar ... 3. Ocurre ..."
                ></textarea>
              </label>
              <label class="span-3">
                <input id="issue-report-mention-claude" name="mentionClaude" type="checkbox" checked />
                Añadir mención a @claude para activar automatización
              </label>
              <button id="issue-report-submit" class="primary-btn" type="submit">Crear issue</button>
            </form>
            <p id="issue-report-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
          </article>

          <aside class="card reports-guide-card">
            <h3>Qué pasará después</h3>
            <ol class="reports-guide-list">
              <li>Se crea una issue en GitHub con tu texto literal y metadatos del contexto.</li>
              <li>Haiku enriquece la issue (hipótesis técnica, alcance y criterios).</li>
              <li>Sonnet intenta un fix pequeño, ejecuta tests y propone una PR.</li>
            </ol>
            <p class="reports-guide-note">La PR no se fusiona automáticamente; revisión manual obligatoria.</p>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>

  <div id="toast" class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <div id="chart-tooltip" class="chart-tooltip" role="tooltip" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</body>
</html>
